<title>USA: Marsh Supermarkets to offer senior notes.</title>
<headline>Marsh Supermarkets to offer senior notes.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marsh Supermarkets Inc said Friday it intends to offer $150 million of senior subordinated notes due 2007.</p>
<p>Proceeds of the offering, which is expected to close in early August, will be used to repay senior unsecured indebtedness and amounts outstanding under revolving credit facilities, and for general corporate purposes including capital expenditures.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
